WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.000
<v Ravi (Product)>If the officer rejects the photo ID, they must write the reason.</v>

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.000
<v Meena (Operations)>And the candidate should get an email saying it was rejected, with that reason.</v>

3
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.000
<v Ravi (Product)>Yes. After a rejection, the candidate can upload a new photo ID.</v>
